                <pb facs="0460" n="390" sameAs="frus:frus1883/pg390"/>

                <head>No. 207.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Frelinghuysen to Mr.
                    Sargent.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1883-10-20"><hi rendition="#italic">October</hi> 20,
                        1883</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Mr. Frelinghuysen telegraphed to Mr. Sargent, instructing that a thorough
                    investigation be made promptly by the nearest consuls of the origin of present
                    trichina cases reported in Germany, for the information of the Commission.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
